---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — CC3PO">
  <section class="section legal-page" style="padding-top:120px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Services</h2>
      <p>CC3PO LLC provides AI-powered compliance scanning, IT management, voice agents, and related services. Our AI agents operate within constraints you define — nothing executes without your approval.</p>

      <h2>2. Human Oversight</h2>
      <p>All AI-generated recommendations require human approval before execution. CC3PO agents surface findings and propose actions — you make the final decision. You are responsible for reviewing and approving all actions that affect your systems, patients, or compliance posture.</p>

      <h2>3. HIPAA Compliance</h2>
      <p>Our scanner identifies potential gaps based on publicly available information. Scanner results are informational only and do not constitute legal or compliance advice. You should consult a qualified compliance professional before acting on scan results.</p>

      <h2>4. Service Availability</h2>
      <p>We strive for 99.9% uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. Scheduled maintenance will be communicated in advance. We are not liable for temporary outages beyond our control.</p>

      <h2>5. Payment Terms</h2>
      <p>Subscription services are billed monthly. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. No refunds for partial months. One-time purchases (e.g., Scanner 2.0) include ongoing updates for 12 months.</p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>CC3PO LLC's total liability shall not exceed the amount paid by you in the 12 months preceding the claim. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>CC3PO LLC<br />For legal inquiries, contact us via our <a href="https://cc3po.io/strategy-call">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color var(--duration-fast);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }
</style>